# The 1.2 prototype: off by default; on lays its values over the live config without writing them to the
# file; off puts the file's values back. The file must still say 50 and 2 while it is on.
/walkers proto
/walkers config forms.trueHealth
/walkers proto on
/walkers proto
/walkers config forms.trueHealth
/walkers config return.afterSeasons
/walkers proto off
/walkers config forms.trueHealth
/walkers config return.afterSeasons
